{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.muddypawsrescue.org/adopt","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Unknown","breed_primary":"Unknown","description_text":"Balto is a very extroverted and inquisitive dog. He loves being around people and has a deep love for attention and companionship. Balto loves to be outside exploring and meeting new people. He also loves to lay next to you and get belly rubs! He is excitable but knows when to relax next to you. He is very smart and and knows how to use his paws to open doors and explore the home.\n\n﻿Balto is approximately 6y 1m 1d old and is fully grown at 43 pounds. They are microchipped and up to date on all age-appropriate medical care. Their breed is unknown as we have not had a DNA test done.\n\nAlthough our dogs are listed as unknown breed, buildings with specific dog restrictions typically enforce their rules based on what breeds a dog appears to resemble. It's always important to keep that in mind and know your building's policies before adopting a dog.\n\nThis dog is available for adoption through Muddy Paws Rescue. If you're interested in adopting, the first thing you should do is begin the registration process at www.muddypawsrescue.org. If you are already a registered adopter with Muddy Paws Rescue, please email us at adoptionmeetings@muddypawsrescue.org.","detail_url":"https://www.muddypawsrescue.org/adoptable?dog=010288","id":"b79977565eac79e995ed4fd81f8294f0","image_urls":["https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/B/BaltoAnimalId010288/i-LkbfZ9V/0/LMTMSh7bFvjPqt9FxwBTPWKFMvrHtzDNjXz9xdDnr/L/IMG_6179-L.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/B/BaltoAnimalId010288/i-hTkvKcK/0/LJCQSbpDZF9F8HL8K7SxwnjNMbcRnnLjcNrgkqBHh/XL/R6M20172-XL.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/B/BaltoAnimalId010288/i-MccMBdS/0/Nfpv5trm28K3hNWMRzXFTTZ7k9JH7GdsKwkkgNWVD/X2/IMG_1650-X2.jpg","https://photos.smugmug.com/Individual-Dog-Assets/B/BaltoAnimalId010288/i-H92f